ules and the grey shape conditions. Remember, patience and concentration are crucial in successfully completing this unique Sudoku challenge. For those who need help, various online resources and guides can provide strategies and tips to overcome any obstacles.\"\n\n\\n\\n\n\n\"In conclusion, this Sudoku puzzle with its special grey shape rules offers a fresh and entertaining take on the classic game. To see the completed puzzle and appreciate its intricate design, readers should purchase the Observer Digital Edition next week. This engaging and stimulating challenge will captivate Sudoku aficionados and those looking to expand their puzzle-solving skills.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.0005393957253545523}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -0.5708073377609253}, {"token": "following", "logprob": -0.153615802526474}, {"token": "is", "logprob": -1.0852570533752441}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -5.245195097813848e-06}, {"token": "description", "logprob": -0.0001333863037871197}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -1.4305104514278355e-06}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "unique", "logprob": -0.9300004243850708}, {"token": "Sud", "logprob": -0.03514678031206131}, {"token": "oku", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "puzzle", "logprob": -0.00021514961554203182}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.004947799723595381}, {"token": "followed", "logprob": -2.697500467300415}, {"token": "by", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -0.020879704505205154}, {"token": "call", "logprob": -0.0016499252524226904}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -0.10020658373832703}, {"token": "action", "logprob": -4.529942543740617e-06}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -1.5033583641052246}, {"token": "access", "logprob": -0.0013304438907653093}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.007625163532793522}, {"token": "printed", "logprob": -0.714175283908844}, {"token": "version", "logprob": -0.00019894051365554333}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0005832401220686734}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -0.0010